cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "OpenYXDB: A reader and writer for Alteryx YXDB files"
message: >
  If you use OpenYXDB in your research, please cite it using the metadata
  below. Citation is encouraged and appreciated but not legally required.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Riley
    given-names: Nathan
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0004-1579-7312"
    website: "https://github.com/Sigilweaver"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Sigilweaver/OpenYXDB"
url: "https://sigilweaver.app"
abstract: >
  OpenYXDB is a standalone, cross-platform reader and writer for Alteryx
  YXDB files, distributed as a Python package with first-class Polars,
  PyArrow, and Pandas integration. No native Alteryx Designer installation
  is required.
license: "Apache-2.0"
